<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>BonID Consent Revoked</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.3.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; background: #f8f9fa; color: #222; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; }
      .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); max-width: 600px; margin: auto; padding: 40px 30px; }
      h1 { color: #E53E3E; margin-bottom: 10px; }
      p { color: #555; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .footer { margin-top: 40px; font-size: 13px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <h1><i class="ri-close-circle-line"></i> Consent Revoked</h1>
      <p>You have revoked consent for <strong><%= @grant.partner.name %></strong>.</p>
      <p>They no longer have access to your identity data through BonID.</p>
      <p class="footer">&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> BonID — All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Consent Revoked</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.3.0/fonts/remixicon.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
      :root {
        --haitian-blue: #00209F;
        --danger-red: #E53E3E;
      }
      body {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7fb;
        color: #333;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 60px 20px;
      }
      .card {
        background: #fff;
        border-radius: 20px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: auto;
        padding: 40px 30px;
      }
      .icon {
        font-size: 60px;
        color: var(--danger-red);
      }
      h1 {
        color: var(--haitian-blue);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      p {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 40px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #888;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="card">
      <i class="ri-close-line icon"></i>
      <h1>Consent Revoked</h1>
      <p>
        <strong><%= @grant.citizen.full_name %></strong> has revoked your BonID data access.
        You no longer have permission to view this user's verified information.
      </p>
      <p class="footer">
        &copy; <%= Time.current.year %> BonID — All rights reserved.
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
